### 1. Creare cont nou (Public)
POST http://localhost/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser4",
  "password": "testpassword",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### 2. Autentificare (Public - Copiază token-ul JWT din răspuns)
POST http://localhost/auth/login?username=testuser4&password=testpassword
Accept: application/json

### 3. Testare securitate (Fără token - Trebuie să returneze 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost/users
Accept: application/json

### 4. Accesare User Service (Cu token - Trebuie să returneze 200 OK)
# Înlocuiește <TOKEN> cu textul lung primit la pasul 2
GET http://localhost/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjQiLCJyb2xlIjoiQ0xJRU5UIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyODY3NjUwLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5MDM2NTB9.qg1StnwMKQg2d20Wg-Lx09loEjfaBbUrIj_OtvO7grU
Accept: application/json

### 5. Accesare Device Service (Cu token - Trebuie să returneze 200 OK)
GET http://localhost/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjQiLCJyb2xlIjoiQ0xJRU5UIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyODY3NjUwLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5MDM2NTB9.qg1StnwMKQg2d20Wg-Lx09loEjfaBbUrIj_OtvO7grU

